content.text:
I found 9 issues in PR #2549, listed most severe first. I made no edits. As the review asked, nothing was double-checked after the initial pass, so some of these may be false positives.

The first one is a real bug: a reviewer that replies with only a malformed JSON line, and no summary or other text, makes trail posting fail with a confusing error. The next three concern what gets posted. Some findings can be dropped, exploration notes can become findings, and some reports with findings get treated as clean. The rest are cleanup and design suggestions.

