    "failure_scenario": "In a 3-reviewer profile with a judge, each reviewer spends extra prompt and output tokens on a JSON line nobody reads. It is only used if synthesis fails. Set TrailFindingsJSON on workers only when no synthesis provider is configured, or document that it exists as a fallback."
